OL,3,GNEWSACampaigner died in crash while
OL,4,Afilming Apple series
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaigner who raised nearly #1m for
OL,7,Fcharity during her life was "excited"
OL,8,Fabout taking part in a microlighting
OL,9,Ffilming project for an Apple headset
OL,10,Fbefore she died, an inquest has heard.
OL,12,FClaire Lomas began fundraising after a
OL,13,F2007 horse riding accident left her
OL,14,Fparalysed, with her efforts including
OL,15,Fcompleting the 2012 London Marathon in
OL,16,Fa "bionic" suit.
OL,18,FHer inquest was told Lomas was flying
OL,19,Fan adapted microlight in Jordan on 15
OL,20,FJuly 2024 when it veered off a road
OL,21,Fafter landing and crashed into a large
OL,22,Frock.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,364,360,200,160,0,100
