OL,3,GNEWSACampaigner died in crash while
OL,4,Afilming Apple series
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe court heard she was then taken to
OL,7,Fthe King Hussein Medical Centre, where
OL,8,FLomas's condition improved before she
OL,9,Fhad a "sudden deterioration" and died
OL,10,Fon 22 August.
